their documented local API (https://docs.iotawatt.com, /status and /query).
This integration is not affiliated with nor endorsed by IoTaWatt, Inc.
IoTaWatt is a trademark of its owner. The endpoints and fields follow the
published documentation and the firmware sources
(https://github.com/boblemaire/IoTaWatt, GPL-3.0), read for the facts only:
no code is taken from them, nor from the iotawattpy library (GPL-3.0).
